# of docs/07-what-failed.md. Key = line number in that file.
# Fields: val, se, hold, hold_se  -> the PRIMARY read (rule: the first-listed arm of the row,
#          or, when the row reports a later/stronger read of the same idea, that read)
#         best, best_se, best_hold -> the most favourable arm/read quoted in the row (for bundles)
#         level, seeds, epochs     -> test strength as far as the row (or its source) says
#         reason                   -> category of closure; detail -> free text
#         rtype                    -> model (a pipeline change) / leak / method / control
#         vderiv                   -> 1 if val was derived from two levels quoted in the row
